#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:4
msgid "v4.4.3"
msgstr "v4.4.3"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:6
msgid ""
"v4.4.3 introduces the **OpenMV RT1060** (NXP i.MX RT1060) board, a much-"
"expanded MJPEG recording API, new ISP image methods (auto white balance, "
"color correction matrix, gamma), and MicroPython 1.20. Arduino board names "
"were changed and the MJPEG defaults shifted — read the breaking changes "
"below."
msgstr ""
"v4.4.3 uvodi ploču **OpenMV RT1060** (NXP i.MX RT1060), znatno prošireni API"
" za MJPEG snimanje, nove ISP metode slike (automatski balans bijele, matrica"
" korekcije boja, gama) te MicroPython 1.20. Promijenjeni su nazivi Arduino "
"ploča i zadane vrijednosti MJPEG-a — pročitajte popis promjena koje "
"narušavaju kompatibilnost u nastavku."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:14
msgid "On this page"
msgstr "Na ovoj stranici"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:17
msgid "Highlights"
msgstr "Istaknuto"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:19
msgid "**OpenMV RT1060** — new NXP i.MX RT1060 board (and a REV2 revision)."
msgstr "**OpenMV RT1060** — nova ploča NXP i.MX RT1060 (i revizija REV2)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:20
msgid ""
"**Expanded MJPEG API** — ``write()``, ``count``, ``is_closed``, ``sync()``, "
"ROI/palette/alpha keywords, and a finalizer."
msgstr ""
"**Prošireni MJPEG API** — ``write()``\\ , ``count``\\ , ``is_closed``\\ , "
"``sync()``\\ , ROI/paleta/alpha ključne riječi te finalizator."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:22
msgid ""
"**New ISP methods** — ``image.awb()``, ``image.ccm()``, ``image.gamma()``."
msgstr ""
"**Nove ISP metode** — ``image.awb()``\\ , ``image.ccm()``\\ , "
"``image.gamma()``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:23
msgid "**MicroPython updated to 1.20.0.**"
msgstr "**MicroPython ažuriran na 1.20.0.**"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:24
msgid ""
"**Breaking:** Arduino board targets were renamed and the MJPEG default "
"quality changed — see the breaking changes."
msgstr ""
"**Narušava kompatibilnost:** Arduino ciljne ploče preimenovane su i "
"promijenjena je zadana kvaliteta MJPEG-a — pogledajte popis promjena koje "
"narušavaju kompatibilnost."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:28
msgid "New features"
msgstr "Nove značajke"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:30
msgid ""
"**OpenMV RT1060** — full NXP i.MX RT1060 port (sensor, GPIO, I2C, SPI "
"drivers) and board configuration, plus support for the RT1060 REV2 board "
"revision and :class:`machine.RTC` alarm/wakeup on the i.MX RT port."
msgstr ""
"**OpenMV RT1060** — potpuni NXP i.MX RT1060 port (senzor, GPIO, I2C, SPI "
"upravljački programi) i konfiguracija ploče, uz podršku za reviziju ploče "
"RT1060 REV2 te :class:`machine.RTC` alarm/buđenje na i.MX RT portu."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:33
msgid ""
"**MJPEG** — a new ``Mjpeg.write()`` method (with ``roi``, ``rgb_channel``, "
"``alpha``, ``color_palette``, ``alpha_palette``, ``hint`` keywords) plus "
"``count``, ``is_closed``, ``sync()`` and a ``__del__`` finalizer, and "
"``MJPEG`` / ``Mjpeg`` / :mod:`mjpeg` constructor aliases."
msgstr ""
"**MJPEG** — nova metoda ``Mjpeg.write()`` (s ključnim riječima ``roi``\\ , "
"``rgb_channel``\\ , ``alpha``\\ , ``color_palette``\\ , ``alpha_palette``\\ "
", ``hint``\\ ) uz ``count``\\ , ``is_closed``\\ , ``sync()`` i ``__del__`` "
"finalizator te aliase konstruktora ``MJPEG`` / ``Mjpeg`` / :mod:`mjpeg`\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:37
msgid ""
"**ISP image methods** — ``image.awb([max])`` (auto white balance), "
"``image.ccm(matrix)`` (3x3 / 4x3 color-correction matrix), and "
"``image.gamma(gamma, contrast, brightness)``."
msgstr ""
"**ISP metode slike** — ``image.awb([max])`` (automatski balans bijele), "
"``image.ccm(matrix)`` (3x3 / 4x3 matrica korekcije boja) i "
"``image.gamma(gamma, contrast, brightness)``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:40
msgid ""
"**AprilTag** — new floating-point centroid attributes ``cxf`` / ``cyf`` "
"(``cx`` / ``cy`` still return rounded integers)."
msgstr ""
"**AprilTag** — novi atributi centroida u pomičnom zarezu ``cxf`` / ``cyf`` "
"(\\ ``cx`` / ``cy`` i dalje vraćaju zaokružene cijele brojeve)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:42
msgid ""
"**ML** — ``tf.regression()`` now accepts a ulab ndarray and supports 2D "
"input tensors (1D still supported); additional TensorFlow Lite ops were "
"enabled in the bundled ``libtf`` libraries."
msgstr ""
"**ML** — ``tf.regression()`` sada prihvaća ulab ndarray i podržava 2D ulazne"
" tenzore (1D je i dalje podržan); omogućene su dodatne TensorFlow Lite "
"operacije u priloženim ``libtf`` bibliotekama."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:47
msgid "Other changes and improvements"
msgstr "Ostale promjene i poboljšanja"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:49
msgid "**MicroPython updated to 1.20.0**; ulab updated to 6.0.12."
msgstr "**MicroPython ažuriran na 1.20.0**\\ ; ulab ažuriran na 6.0.12."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:50
msgid ""
"``image.gamma`` / ``gamma_corr`` reworked as an ISP method and extended to "
"support Bayer and YUV images (not just mutable images)."
msgstr ""
"``image.gamma`` / ``gamma_corr`` preuređeni su kao ISP metoda i prošireni za"
" podršku Bayer i YUV slikama (ne samo promjenjivim slikama)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:52
msgid ""
"STM32 boards (Portenta H7, Nicla Vision) switched to the open-source cyw43 "
"WiFi driver."
msgstr ""
"STM32 ploče (Portenta H7, Nicla Vision) prešle su na cyw43 WiFi upravljački "
"program otvorenog koda."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:54
msgid ""
"The :mod:`rtsp` library was made portable (uses :mod:`random`/:mod:`time` "
"instead of :mod:`pyb`); ``urequests`` now always closes its socket."
msgstr ""
":mod:`rtsp` biblioteka učinjena je prenosivom (koristi :mod:`random`\\ /\\ "
":mod:`time` umjesto :mod:`pyb`\\ ); ``urequests`` sada uvijek zatvara svoj "
"socket."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:58
msgid "Bug fixes"
msgstr "Ispravci grešaka"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:60
msgid "Camera and sensors:"
msgstr "Kamera i senzori:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:62
msgid ""
"Fixed OV767x clock rate (CLKRC) on the Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense, OV7670 "
"CLKRC bypass/pre-scaler handling, and swapped D0/D1 data lines on the "
"Arduino Nicla Vision / ML kit (nrf port)."
msgstr ""
"Ispravljen OV767x takt (CLKRC) na Arduino Nano 33 BLE Sense, rukovanje "
"OV7670 CLKRC zaobilaženjem/predskalerom te zamijenjene D0/D1 podatkovne "
"linije na Arduino Nicla Vision / ML kompletu (nrf port)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:66
msgid "System and USB:"
msgstr "Sustav i USB:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:68
msgid ""
"Fixed short-USB-packet handling in TinyUSB debug mode (more reliable "
"IDE/host transfers)."
msgstr ""
"Ispravljeno rukovanje kratkim USB paketima u TinyUSB načinu otklanjanja "
"pogrešaka (pouzdaniji prijenosi prema IDE-u/računalu)."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:70
msgid ""
"Fixed the OpenMV RT1060 blinking-LED polarity and SD-card detection on "
"power-on."
msgstr ""
"Ispravljen polaritet trepćuće LED diode i otkrivanje SD kartice pri "
"uključivanju na OpenMV RT1060."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:74
msgid "Hardware and board support"
msgstr "Podrška za hardver i ploče"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:76
msgid "**OpenMV RT1060** — new NXP i.MX RT1060 board, plus the REV2 revision."
msgstr "**OpenMV RT1060** — nova ploča NXP i.MX RT1060, uz reviziju REV2."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:77
msgid ""
"**STM32** — Portenta H7 / Nicla Vision moved to the open-source cyw43 WiFi "
"driver."
msgstr ""
"**STM32** — Portenta H7 / Nicla Vision prešli na cyw43 WiFi upravljački "
"program otvorenog koda."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:81
msgid "Breaking API changes"
msgstr "Promjene API-ja koje narušavaju kompatibilnost"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:83
msgid ""
"User-visible API breaks between v4.4.2 and v4.4.3. Scope: Python C-modules "
"in ``modules/`` and Python libraries in ``scripts/libraries/``."
msgstr ""
"Korisniku vidljive promjene API-ja koje narušavaju kompatibilnost između "
"v4.4.2 i v4.4.3. Opseg: Python C-moduli u ``modules/`` i Python biblioteke u"
" ``scripts/libraries/``\\ ."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:86
msgid "Each change is tagged with its impact:"
msgstr "Svaka promjena označena je svojim utjecajem:"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:88
msgid "*behavior* — same API, different results; re-check tuned scripts."
msgstr ""
"*behavior* — isti API, drugačiji rezultati; ponovno provjerite ugođene "
"skripte."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:89
msgid "*tooling* — affects board naming / flashing, not the Python API."
msgstr "*tooling* — utječe na imenovanje / flashanje ploča, ne na Python API."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:91
msgid ""
"Changes are grouped by impact in that order. Each commit hash links to its "
"diff on GitHub."
msgstr ""
"Promjene su grupirane po utjecaju tim redoslijedom. Svaki hash commita vodi "
"na njegov diff na GitHubu."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:97
msgid "MJPEG defaults and error handling *(behavior)*"
msgstr "Zadane vrijednosti MJPEG-a i rukovanje greškama *(behavior)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:99
msgid ""
"The MJPEG recording code was overhauled. The default ``add_frame()`` / "
"``write()`` JPEG ``quality`` was raised from 50 to 90 (recordings are larger"
" and higher quality by default), an invalid quality now raises "
"``ValueError``, operating on a closed file now raises ``OSError``, and the "
"recording methods now return the ``Mjpeg`` object. Scripts that depended on "
"the old default quality or the previous error behavior should be re-checked."
msgstr ""
"Kod za MJPEG snimanje temeljito je preuređen. Zadana JPEG ``quality`` za "
"``add_frame()`` / ``write()`` podignuta je s 50 na 90 (snimke su prema "
"zadanim postavkama veće i veće kvalitete), nevažeća kvaliteta sada izaziva "
"``ValueError``\\ , rad s zatvorenom datotekom sada izaziva ``OSError``\\ , a"
" metode snimanja sada vraćaju ``Mjpeg`` objekt. Skripte koje su ovisile o "
"staroj zadanoj kvaliteti ili prethodnom ponašanju pri greškama treba ponovno"
" provjeriti."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:106
msgid ""
"*Commit:* `3fc55ad31 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/3fc55ad31>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commit:* `3fc55ad31 <https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/3fc55ad31>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:111
msgid "Arduino board targets renamed *(tooling)*"
msgstr "Preimenovane Arduino ciljne ploče *(tooling)*"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:113
msgid ""
"The Arduino board targets were renamed to an updated naming convention and "
"all board manifests (frozen module sets) were refreshed. This does not "
"change the Python API, but the firmware file/board names used to build or "
"flash Arduino boards changed — update your tooling accordingly."
msgstr ""
"Arduino ciljne ploče preimenovane su prema ažuriranoj konvenciji imenovanja "
"i svi manifesti ploča (skupovi zamrznutih modula) osvježeni su. Time se ne "
"mijenja Python API, ali su se promijenili nazivi datoteka/ploča ugrađenog "
"programa koji se koriste za izgradnju ili flashanje Arduino ploča — "
"ažurirajte svoje alate u skladu s tim."

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:118
msgid ""
"*Commits:* `77a7d16c0 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/77a7d16c0>`__, `59d9f2603 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/59d9f2603>`__"
msgstr ""
"*Commiti:* `77a7d16c0 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/77a7d16c0>`__\\ , `59d9f2603 "
"<https://github.com/openmv/openmv/commit/59d9f2603>`__"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:122
msgid "Migration checklist"
msgstr "Kontrolni popis za migraciju"

#: ../../changelog/firmware/v4.4.3.rst:124
msgid ""
"For a clean port to v4.4.3: re-check MJPEG recordings for the new default "
"quality and error behavior (:ref:`the MJPEG change <v4_4_3_mjpeg>`), and "
"update build/flash tooling for the renamed Arduino board targets (:ref:`the "
"board renaming <v4_4_3_boards>`). All other scripts run unchanged."
msgstr ""
"Za čistu prilagodbu na v4.4.3: ponovno provjerite MJPEG snimke zbog nove "
"zadane kvalitete i ponašanja pri greškama (\\ :ref:`promjena MJPEG-a "
"<v4_4_3_mjpeg>`\\ ) te ažurirajte alate za izgradnju/flashanje za "
"preimenovane Arduino ciljne ploče (\\ :ref:`preimenovanje ploča "
"<v4_4_3_boards>`\\ ). Sve ostale skripte rade nepromijenjeno."
